    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Rajya Sabha holds exclusive powers under Article 249 (State List legislation) and Article 312 (Creation of All India Services).",
        "The decision of the Lok Sabha Speaker on whether a bill is a Money Bill is final.",
        "The President is an integral part of Parliament under Article 79, despite not being a member of either House.",
        "Disqualification decisions under the Anti-Defection Law by the Presiding Officer are subject to judicial review."
      ],
      "id": "hr4r370"
